# race-conditions Rule

When auditing race conditions:
1. Follow `.agents/skills/race-conditions/references/race_checklist.md` (RC-001 to RC-015, RC-L-* limit sweep).
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/race-conditions/SKILL.md`. Track progress with `references/race_tracker.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first. Use `.agents/skills/race-conditions/scripts/race_probe.py` for small synchronized bursts (5 by default, more needs --approved, cap 20).
4. Money, coupons, gift cards, inventory, and distributed tests are authorized-only. One burst per attempt; never loop.
